HISTORY lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                         HISTORY flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                           HISTORY uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)],                    HISTORY flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].                           HISTORY                                                                         HISTORY The spectra in the file(s) spectra0161.fits, spectra0162.fits,          HISTORY spectra0163.fits, spectra0164.fits, spectra0169.fits,                   HISTORY spectra0170.fits, spectra0171.fits, spectra0172.fits were               HISTORY combined using a robust weighted mean with a sigma threshold of         HISTORY 8.  Aperture 1 modifications: The scale factors were determined         HISTORY using order 1 and are: 0.42417964315787826, 0.9990115567584084,         HISTORY 0.898903341862459, 3.9716555878808193, 0.47639056263960156,             HISTORY 1.0009904011522424, 2.4432111922747715, 118.82334466033076.             END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             